os. La razón entre observados y esperados es 4,7, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 3,2 a 6,8. En diciembre se adjudicó el 2 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 1 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 40 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.696,34 euros, se adjudicó en noviembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no implica irregularidades, ya que puede deberse a factores como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No se puede asumir que haya actuado mal alguien solo por estar cerca del límite.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en años distintos. Analizar si los contratos al límite se distribuyen por áreas o servicios específicos.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 58 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 12.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 4.7, with a 95% confidence interval of 3.2 to 6.8. December accounts for 2% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 1% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 40 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,696.34 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows a pattern of contracts just under the limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. Prices could be standard, budgets fixed, or needs separate. Statistical trends don't indicate improper actions by the body or contractors.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the contracts to see if they align with the body's needs. Review awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same service or supply. Look at contract [1] to see what was purchased and how it fits within the legal limit.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["8NdIiYUp4OWFQ%2FlhRK79lA%3D%3D","sgOgnHvh6jLE6P%2FuLemXRw%3D%3D","o620u5%2F7wWjpxJFXpLZ%2B2A%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}